    "body": "Implemented one shared help marker for FF8 and RDR2. Field explainers and the contextual help toggle now use a filled circular `?`, with the game's theme color, useful hover text, and keyboard focus. The old bare and outlined variants are removed. Missing-content placeholders, such as an absent portrait, remain separate.\n\nRendered checks passed in both game themes.",
